- stack (haskell): 3 claims change attribution only, evidence counts
  equal: System.Process.Text / System.Directory.Extra / System.Process.
  Typed -> System.Process / System.Directory. Checked against the call
  sites' imports: etc/scripts/release.hs, install-many-stack-releases.hs
  and src/Stack/Upgrade.hs import System.Process / System.Directory, so
